-- This data file containing error codes will be handled as error on modeling consistency check in the Pipe Fabrication
-- These error codes will be ignored if "Full data consistency check" is unselected.
-- 
-- List up error code on datata consistency check.
-- The error code can be checked using below commands
-- check ce !checkedElements !errorCodes
-- q var !errorCodes
--
--<ARRAY>
--   [1]  <STRING> '62 62 '
--   [2]  <STRING> '62 62 '
--   [3]  <STRING> '62 103 '
--   [4]  <STRING> '62 '
--   [5]  <STRING> '41 '
--   [6]  <STRING> '62 '
--   [7]  <STRING> '53 '
--
--
-- [Format] : Error-code 'Description'
-- Note. Description can be skipped.
--       A desciption is not affect the result. (It is only used as reference.) 
--       A definition for an error should be written in one line.
--
